    {
      "id": "claim_5946b80b745a4c2992414070b9062cdc",
      "statement": "AI-assisted coding (Claude Code) runs on the Claude MAX subscription. `MCM_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` is mapped to `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` only at the point of use in three separate processes (`agent-stack.mjs`, `wiki-maintain.mjs`, containerized E2E). Setting `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` in any environment silently bills pay-per-token; this was measured at ~$15 unintended spend in one day (2026-08-16).",
