    {
      "id": "claim_92efebf75d9f4acfa0e4cd8f1644977d",
      "statement": "A PR's head must be a real branch (`git push origin HEAD:<branch>`), not an AGit push (`HEAD:refs/for/main`). An AGit push yields a `refs/pull/N/head` head that Forgejo runs with NO Actions secrets — every `${{ secrets.* }}` is empty. This cost two sessions on issue #126.",
