    {
      "id": "claim_59d86e031a974bd98950cae7297be71e",
      "statement": "`--name` is load-bearing on `sbx run` because the first positional argument is an agent, not a sandbox name. Omitting it can create a second sandbox instead of restarting the existing one.",
