    {
      "id": "claim_ea4d53b90dee4893a3e4a8838f08e294",
      "statement": "`sbx template save` snapshots the VM root filesystem, not the Docker data disk, so a sandbox recreated from a template starts with zero images. The egress policy is also not carried in a template — a recreated sandbox gets the default profile and must have its policy re-applied.",
