    {
      "id": "claim_51ac2a450acc4ebab5ed02fc22c081e0",
      "statement": "`sbx run` mounts the current directory as the sandbox workspace over virtiofs, read-write, unless an explicit path is given. Creating a sandbox from inside the repo mounts the repo into the VM. Measured 2026-08-16: a file written inside a recreated sandbox appeared immediately in the Windows working copy.",
      "evidence": [
